# Staging directory for baked-in model artifacts.
# Place model files here before building the ECS worker image, e.g.
#   xgboost-model.ubj   (portable XGBoost save_model format, from step 2)
#   sarima-model.pkl    (optional)
#   arima-model.pkl     (optional)
# The worker also accepts a legacy xgboost-model.pkl / xgboost-model.json.
# Actual artifacts are git-ignored and must not be committed.
